sequenceDiagram
    participant Client as Client (CLI/SDK)
    participant Gateway as OpenShell Gateway<br/>8080/TCP gRPC<br/>TLS 1.2+
    participant K8sAPI as Kubernetes API<br/>443/TCP HTTPS
    participant SandboxPod as Sandbox Pod<br/>2222/TCP SSH
    participant Supervisor as Supervisor<br/>5500/TCP TLS
    participant Sandbox as Sandbox Binary<br/>Static glibc
    participant OPA as OPA Policy Engine<br/>In-process (regorus)
    participant CredStore as Credential Store<br/>In-process
    participant ModelAPI as Model Provider API<br/>443/TCP HTTPS

    Note over Client,ModelAPI: Flow 1: Sandbox Creation (Kubernetes)

    Client->>Gateway: CreateSandbox RPC<br/>Auth: OIDC Bearer
    Gateway->>Gateway: Z3 Policy Verification<br/>Prove boundary correctness
    Gateway->>K8sAPI: Create Sandbox CRD<br/>agents.x-k8s.io/v1<br/>Auth: ServiceAccount Token
    K8sAPI-->>Gateway: Sandbox Pod Scheduled
    Gateway->>SandboxPod: SSH Connection<br/>2222/TCP mTLS<br/>Auth: Client Certificate
    SandboxPod-->>Gateway: Sandbox Ready

    Note over Supervisor,Gateway: Supervisor registers with Gateway
    Supervisor->>Gateway: Session Registration<br/>8080/TCP gRPC TLS<br/>Auth: mTLS (projected SA token)
    Gateway-->>Supervisor: Session Established

    Note over Client,ModelAPI: Flow 2: Policy-Enforced Agent Egress

    Sandbox->>Supervisor: HTTP/CONNECT Request<br/>Loopback (no encryption)
    Supervisor->>OPA: Evaluate Egress Policy<br/>In-process (regorus)
    OPA-->>Supervisor: Policy Decision<br/>(allow/deny + constraints)

    alt Policy Allows
        Supervisor->>CredStore: Resolve Provider Credentials<br/>In-process
        CredStore-->>Supervisor: Injected Credentials<br/>(never written to sandbox filesystem)
        Supervisor->>ModelAPI: HTTPS Request<br/>443/TCP TLS 1.2+<br/>Auth: Injected Provider Creds
        ModelAPI-->>Supervisor: API Response
        Supervisor-->>Sandbox: Proxied Response
    else Policy Denies
        Supervisor-->>Sandbox: 403 Denied<br/>Denial Aggregation Logged
    end
